    "text": "A junction diode has a resistance of $25 \\Omega$ when forward biased and $2500 \\Omega$ when reverse biased. The current in the diode, for the arrangement shown will be\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/wbjee/OWBV48beSVcoKVMHfHYHaPhh3mK3e_IpE3Pi4kL084g.original.fullsize.png\"><br>",
